        <div class="inline-block px-4 py-1 bg-green-900/30 border border-green-500/30 rounded-full text-xs font-mono text-green-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-6">Executive Mind Product • Freeware • v3.1</div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold text-white mb-4">COLDSTACK</h1>
        <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-green-400 font-mono mb-2">Secure Crypto Key Storage</p>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-2">Formerly Key Manager — now ColdStack</p>
        <p class="text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8 mt-4">A portable, self-contained ~45MB Windows application for encrypting and managing cryptocurrency wallet information. Built by <strong class="text-green-300">Kris Racette</strong> with military-grade encryption standards. Now with a user-initiated Check for Updates feature — offline by default, zero telemetry.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
